#: en/revolution/modules/armies/partials/infiltration_b.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Instead individual units can be infiltrated onto the battlefield once the "
"game has begun.  To infiltrate a unit, the player nominates the point where "
"he wants the {infiltration-unit} to appear and issues an ‘infiltration’ "
"order from any character.  The character does not have to be within his "
"normal command range to issue an infiltration order – the character’s "
"command range is considered to extend over the entire tabletop when issuing "
"an infiltration order."
